	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Name = `01. Route Message & Temporality-Note01RouteMessage`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Identifier = `ref_models.Note01RouteMessage`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Body = `01. Route Message & Temporality Story

An [models.AIXMBasicMessage] packages en-route ATS/RNAV routes and segments via [models.BasicMessageMemberAIXMPropertyType].
Each feature ([models.RouteType], [models.RouteSegmentType]) is versioned through [models.RouteTimeSliceType] and
[models.RouteSegmentTimeSliceType] slices whose validity interval is specified by ValidTime ([models.TimePrimitivePropertyType]).
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.BodyHTML = `<p>01. Route Message &amp; Temporality Story
<p>An <a href="/models#AIXMBasicMessage">models.AIXMBasicMessage</a> packages en-route ATS/RNAV routes and segments via <a href="/models#BasicMessageMemberAIXMPropertyType">models.BasicMessageMemberAIXMPropertyType</a>.
Each feature (<a href="/models#RouteType">models.RouteType</a>, <a href="/models#RouteSegmentType">models.RouteSegmentType</a>) is versioned through <a href="/models#RouteTimeSliceType">models.RouteTimeSliceType</a> and
<a href="/models#RouteSegmentTimeSliceType">models.RouteSegmentTimeSliceType</a> slices whose validity interval is specified by ValidTime (<a href="/models#TimePrimitivePropertyType">models.TimePrimitivePropertyType</a>).
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.X = 40.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Y = 20.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Width = 640.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Height = 124.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.IsHidden = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.Matched = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000000_.IsExpanded = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Name = `02. Route & RoutePortion-Note02RoutePortion`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Identifier = `ref_models.Note02RoutePortion`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Body = `02. Route & RoutePortion Story

A [models.RouteTimeSliceType] identifies an ATS or RNAV airway (designator prefix, second letter, number, and navigation type).
Sub-sections of a route are referenced via [models.RoutePortionType] and documented with [models.NoteType] and [models.LinguisticNoteType].
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.BodyHTML = `<p>02. Route &amp; RoutePortion Story
<p>A <a href="/models#RouteTimeSliceType">models.RouteTimeSliceType</a> identifies an ATS or RNAV airway (designator prefix, second letter, number, and navigation type).
Sub-sections of a route are referenced via <a href="/models#RoutePortionType">models.RoutePortionType</a> and documented with <a href="/models#NoteType">models.NoteType</a> and <a href="/models#LinguisticNoteType">models.LinguisticNoteType</a>.
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.X = 40.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Y = 20.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Width = 640.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Height = 106.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.IsHidden = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.Matched = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000001_.IsExpanded = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Name = `03. RouteSegment & RouteAvailability-Note03RouteSegment`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Identifier = `ref_models.Note03RouteSegment`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Body = `03. RouteSegment & RouteAvailability Story

A [models.RouteSegmentTimeSliceType] connects start and end [models.EnRouteSegmentPointType] fixes along a 2D [models.CurveType] path.
Directional and altitude-band opening/closure schedules are defined by [models.RouteAvailabilityType] and [models.AirspaceLayerType].
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.BodyHTML = `<p>03. RouteSegment &amp; RouteAvailability Story
<p>A <a href="/models#RouteSegmentTimeSliceType">models.RouteSegmentTimeSliceType</a> connects start and end <a href="/models#EnRouteSegmentPointType">models.EnRouteSegmentPointType</a> fixes along a 2D <a href="/models#CurveType">models.CurveType</a> path.
Directional and altitude-band opening/closure schedules are defined by <a href="/models#RouteAvailabilityType">models.RouteAvailabilityType</a> and <a href="/models#AirspaceLayerType">models.AirspaceLayerType</a>.
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.X = 40.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Y = 20.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Width = 640.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Height = 106.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.IsHidden = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.Matched = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000002_.IsExpanded = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.Name = `04. RouteDME & ChangeOverPoint-Note04ChangeOverPoint`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.Identifier = `ref_models.Note04ChangeOverPoint`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.Body = `04. RouteDME & ChangeOverPoint Story

[models.RouteDMETimeSliceType] associates DME distance references with an airway segment, while [models.ChangeOverPointTimeSliceType]
specifies the point along a segment where aircraft transition navigation guidance from the behind facility to the ahead facility via [models.PointReferenceType].
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.BodyHTML = `<p>04. RouteDME &amp; ChangeOverPoint Story
<p><a href="/models#RouteDMETimeSliceType">models.RouteDMETimeSliceType</a> associates DME distance references with an airway segment, while <a href="/models#ChangeOverPointTimeSliceType">models.ChangeOverPointTimeSliceType</a>
specifies the point along a segment where aircraft transition navigation guidance from the behind facility to the ahead facility via <a href="/models#PointReferenceType">models.PointReferenceType</a>.
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.X = 40.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.Y = 20.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.Width = 640.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.Height = 124.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.IsHidden = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.Matched = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000003_.IsExpanded = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.Name = `05. FlightRestriction & Routing Elements-Note05FlightRestriction`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.Identifier = `ref_models.Note05FlightRestriction`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.Body = `05. FlightRestriction & Routing Elements Story

Traffic flow restrictions (RAD / conditional routing rules) are modeled on [models.FlightRestrictionTimeSliceType].
Allowed or forbidden routings are sequences of [models.FlightRestrictionRouteType], [models.FlightRoutingElementType], and [models.FlightRestrictionLevelType].
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.BodyHTML = `<p>05. FlightRestriction &amp; Routing Elements Story
<p>Traffic flow restrictions (RAD / conditional routing rules) are modeled on <a href="/models#FlightRestrictionTimeSliceType">models.FlightRestrictionTimeSliceType</a>.
Allowed or forbidden routings are sequences of <a href="/models#FlightRestrictionRouteType">models.FlightRestrictionRouteType</a>, <a href="/models#FlightRoutingElementType">models.FlightRoutingElementType</a>, and <a href="/models#FlightRestrictionLevelType">models.FlightRestrictionLevelType</a>.
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.X = 40.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.Y = 20.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.Width = 640.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.Height = 124.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.IsHidden = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.Matched = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000004_.IsExpanded = false
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000005_.Name = `06. Flight Conditions, DirectFlight & RulesProcedures-Note06FlightConditions`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000005_.Identifier = `ref_models.Note06FlightConditions`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000005_.Body = `06. Flight Conditions, DirectFlight & RulesProcedures Story

[models.AirspaceBorderCrossingTimeSliceType] and [models.RulesProceduresTimeSliceType] capture border-crossing constraints and regional rules
using boolean logic trees of [models.FlightConditionCombinationType], [models.FlightConditionElementType], and [models.DirectFlightSegmentType].
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000005_.BodyHTML = `<p>06. Flight Conditions, DirectFlight &amp; RulesProcedures Story
<p><a href="/models#AirspaceBorderCrossingTimeSliceType">models.AirspaceBorderCrossingTimeSliceType</a> and <a href="/models#RulesProceduresTimeSliceType">models.RulesProceduresTimeSliceType</a> capture border-crossing constraints and regional rules
using boolean logic trees of <a href="/models#FlightConditionCombinationType">models.FlightConditionCombinationType</a>, <a href="/models#FlightConditionElementType">models.FlightConditionElementType</a>, and <a href="/models#DirectFlightSegmentType">models.DirectFlightSegmentType</a>.
`
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000005_.X = 40.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000005_.Y = 20.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000005_.Width = 640.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000005_.Height = 124.000000
	__models__GongNoteShape__00000005_.IsHidden = false
